  "description": "The Abound LR is the answer to all your cargo conundrums! The 750W motor, long rear rack, and 440lb payload capacity make this the ultimate cargo carrier. Whether you're loading up the kids, your beach day essentials, or your most ambitious grocery haul, the Abound LR is ready to take on any challenge. With a gravity cast frame, adjustable quill stem, front suspension, and suspension seatpost, you can ride confidently and comfortably no matter what you're bringing along. With the addition of ACU technology, you'll rest assured knowing you can locate and control your bike from anywhere. The possibilities for what you can carry are endless, so load up and enjoy the ride with Abound LR.",
